sequenceDiagram
    participant API as /husk/fpe
    participant H as fpe.husk
    participant K as _load_key
    participant T as _TOKEN_RE.sub
    participant E as cipher (pyffx or hmac)

    API->>H: husk(input, crumb_level, options)
    H->>K: _load_key (FPE_KEY env or default)
    K-->>H: 16-byte key
    H->>E: probe pyffx then fallback to hmac on failure
    loop each token match
        T->>H: token
        alt string or comment token
            H-->>T: pass through verbatim
        else keyword or skipped by crumb_level
            H-->>T: keep as-is
        else seen before
            H-->>T: cached pseudonym
        else new identifier
            H->>E: encrypt(token)
            E-->>H: pseudonym
            H-->>T: pseudonym (cached)
        end
    end
    H-->>API: (output, meta with counts and backend)
